althy in production was v2.3.0. I rolled all three regions back to it. A follow-up check shows the service healthy, with the error rate down to about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api) describes the v2.3.1 failure and the rollback, and recommends finding the root cause before redeploying. Opening it paged the on-call engineer.\n\nv2.3.1 shouldn't be redeployed until it's fixed. Since it has never been healthy in production, redeploying it would also need change-manager approval under policy.", "type": "text"}]}]}